<title>USA: N.Y. Methodist Hospital yields 6.05 pct in 2034.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Methodist Hospital yields 6.05 pct in 2034.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Wednesday it tentatively priced $29.3 million Dormitory Authoriyt of the State of New York bonds, for New York Methodist Hospital, to yield 6.05 percent in 2034.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
